# Instructions for Google Play Release Signing:
# 1. Generate an upload keystore if you don't have one:
#    keytool -genkey -v -keystore upload-keystore.jks -keyalg RSA -keysize 2048 -validity 10000 -alias upload
# 2. Place upload-keystore.jks in android/app/ or specify its absolute/relative path below.
# 3. Rename this file to `key.properties` (never commit key.properties to public git):
#
# storePassword=<your-keystore-password>
# keyPassword=<your-key-password>
# keyAlias=upload
# storeFile=upload-keystore.jks

